<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Furniture *definition* editor: one row of furniture_definitions, i.e. a furniture type rather than
  a placed item.

  NOT from the Habbo dump — an authored Vortex layout, registered by App.registerVortexLayouts().

  Follows the glaze authored-layout vocabulary: tinted section header bars (container background
  0xffe9e9f2 + bold il_button label), a shared label column (x=8) and field column (x=96) so inputs
  line up, 21-high style-105 input boxes and style-100 dropmenus. The interaction (logic) and the
  four enums are dropmenus rather than "guess the number" inputs.

  Explicit Save, not per-field commit: the server rewrites the whole row at once (see
  FurniDefinitionView).
-->
